                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi ℱ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{F}
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-limit"} 2-limit
            in its 2-category of loose morphisms, with the property that certain specified projections from the limit object are tight and “jointly detect tightness”, in the sense that a morphism into the limit is tight if and only if its composites with all of the specified projections are tight. Details and examples can be found in (
            %a{:href => "#LS"}> LS
            ).
          %p
            One of the most important things about
            = succeed "-categories" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi ℱ
